    old "Then go to her house on a weekday evening and study with her."
    new "Sonra hafta içi bir akşam onun evine gidip onunla ders çalış."

    # game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieStudy/jamiestudy0.rpy:19
    old "That sounds fun."
    new "Kulağa eğlenceli geliyor."

    # game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieStudy/jamiestudy0.rpy:24
    old "I'd rather just study you."
    new "Ben daha çok seni incelemek isterim."

    # game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieStudy/jamiestudy0.rpy:27
    old "Yeah, I guess so."
    new "Evet, sanırım öyle."

    # game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieStudy/jamiestudy0.rpy:32
    old "Nah, I'll just come back some other time."
    new "Yok, başka bir zaman gelirim."

